| Prepare rollback ticket and rollback pipeline | [Developer] | Rollback branch prepared **before** release day |
| Get rollback approval from Manager | [Developer] | |
| Execute rollback | Release Manager | |
| Production verification after rollback | [QA] | Confirm the previous version is working |
| Notify all channels of the result | [Developer], [QA] | |

